OL,3,GNEWSARosebank: Life on the oil field at
OL,4,Athe centre of a political storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen we landed by helicopter at
OL,7,FRosebank, this oil field was at the
OL,8,Fcentre of a political storm - and set
OL,9,Fto be in the path of a real one.
OL,11,FWe arrived on Wednesday morning, just a
OL,12,Ffew hours after the UK government had
OL,13,Fgranted consent for the production of
OL,14,Fgas from the Jackdaw field in the North
OL,15,FSea.
OL,17,FBut already attention was shifting to
OL,18,Fthis wild and windy patch of the North
OL,19,FAtlantic ` the next big decision for
OL,20,FEnergy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
