OL,3,GNEWSARosebank: Life on the oil field at
OL,4,Athe centre of a political storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FRosebank is bigger than Jackdaw, it
OL,7,Fwould generate higher greenhouse gas
OL,8,Femissions, and it could be far more
OL,9,Flucrative for its owners, Adura and
OL,10,FIthaca.
